[TMP]/rune.config.ts is not a valid rune config

script `ci` sets `dependsOn` beside `serial`

a group already says what runs and in which order — its member list. A second ordering
on the same entry would have no unambiguous meaning. Put the prerequisite first in
the member list instead.
